WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.780
It's as if you've worked a long day in your life,

2
00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.150
you've worked a long day and then

3
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.640
you come home, you can take off your shoes, you

4
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.140
can sit in your armchair with a good beer,

5
00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.020
it's a stage for you, where you are happy

6
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.790
with the work you've done, for once you're happy,

7
00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.930
you say to yourself, "There, a big job

8
00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.310
has been done."

9
00:00:28.058 --> 00:00:30.478
You're sitting there, you're resting a little,

10
00:00:30.518 --> 00:00:32.328
you're resting your body a little,

11
00:00:33.318 --> 00:00:35.108
and then you rest your mind a little.

12
00:00:41.058 --> 00:00:43.858
You develop a small quality in your mind.

13
00:00:44.198 --> 00:00:46.738
You light this small flame that I'm going to suggest

14
00:00:46.778 --> 00:00:47.418
you light,

15
00:00:47.538 --> 00:00:50.438
which is a small flame that should try to remind you

16
00:00:50.478 --> 00:00:51.398
of contentment.

17
00:00:53.018 --> 00:00:54.458
To learn to...

18
00:00:56.116 --> 00:00:58.696
instant, to appreciate what we have.

19
00:01:05.836 --> 00:01:07.136
We're off to the skull.

